description: Pre-flight gate before shipping a section or claiming a landing done
alwaysApply: true
---

# Section build gate (must)

Do not say “done” or move to the next screenshot until this gate passes.

## Layout lock (first 10 minutes)

1. Count columns from screenshot (write them in a short comment if helpful)
2. Set grid/`flex` structure + widths **before** typography polish
3. Place trust/stats/orbit items in the structure pass, not as an afterthought

Rework cost is highest when polish happens on a wrong grid.

## Visual fidelity

- [ ] Correct bg asset from SECTION-GUIDE / brand
- [ ] Layered: color → image → content `z-10`
- [ ] No hard cream/white wall killing the photo
- [ ] Full-bleed strips that belong outside nested cards are **outside**

## Interaction

- [ ] Icons present where design shows them
- [ ] Hover + `cursor-pointer` on interactive UI
- [ ] Motion enter directions match L/R structure; `viewport={{ once: true }}`

## Responsive

Mentally (or browser) check: **320 · 390 · 768 · 1024 · 1280+**
- No horizontal scroll (`min-w-0`, `overflow-x-clip`)
- CTAs `w-full` on phone when designed
- Decorative vertical text hidden below `xl:` if it overflows

## Data / config

- [ ] Copy in `src/data/*` (no em/en dashes)
- [ ] Paths/colors in `src/config/brand|site`
- [ ] Thin `page.tsx` only composes sections

## Ship check

- [ ] `npm run build` green when claiming page/section complete
- [ ] If user sent a “fix” image: treat it as new source of truth; update structure first, not only CSS tweaks

## Landing complete (extra must)

When claiming a **whole landing / site** done (not just one section):

- [ ] Themed **404** exists: `src/app/not-found.tsx` + `src/data/error.ts` (`error-page.mdc`)
- [ ] No blank Next.js default error UI
- [ ] **Scroll chrome:** theme scrollbar + `ScrollToTop` + fixed nav with active bg after `scrollY > ~64` (`scroll-chrome.mdc`)
- [ ] Responsive chrome at 320 → 1280+ (no overflow)
- [ ] **Favicon:** brand logo icons, **transparent** pad (`favicon-brand.mdc`)
- [ ] **SEO:** metadata + JSON-LD + robots + sitemap (`seo.mdc`)
- [ ] **Fast loading:** hero LCP, font swap, dynamic below-fold, `images.qualities` (`fast-loading.mdc`)
- [ ] Hydration-safe client UI (`hydration-safe.mdc`)
- [ ] Bootstrap checklist done (`landing-bootstrap.mdc`)
